  "title": "AMBER",
  "handle": "amber",
  "body_html": "<p>Amber reveals a warmth that unfolds slowly, carrying an irresistible charm. It finds softness in depth with quiet confidence. A glow impossible to ignore.</p>\n<p>The 100 ml Extrait de Parfum, with a 30% concentration, is designed for long-lasting wear and a powerful sillage, carrying its presence from morning into night.</p>\n<p>The Beautiful Darkness presents a perfect combination of three perfumes, designed to be worn alone or layered.</p>",
